&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>A web application that represents a &lt;strong>&lt;a href="https://beets.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">beets&lt;/a>&lt;/strong> music library as an &lt;strong>interactive constellation&lt;/strong>. Each star is an album or artist, and the links between them illustrate relationships (genres, years, similarities).&lt;/p>
&lt;p>A poetic, visual way to explore your music collection.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Connect to a beets library (via the beets web API)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>SVG/Canvas constellation graph representation&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Interactive navigation (zoom, pan, select)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Filter by genre, decade, artist&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Stack&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="stack">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#stack" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>TypeScript&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Visualisation: D3.js or Canvas&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Backend: beets API&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Links&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="links">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/music-constellation" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Language: TypeScript&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Bitfocus Companion modules</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/companion-modules/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/companion-modules/</guid><description>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://bitfocus.io/companion" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bitfocus Companion&lt;/a> turns an Elgato Stream Deck into a professional control surface for broadcast and stage equipment. These modules integrate specific devices.&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2>companion-module-canon-network-legacy-http&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="companion-module-canon-network-legacy-http">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#companion-module-canon-network-legacy-http" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Repository&lt;/strong> · &lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/companion-module-canon-network-legacy-http" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/dewiweb/companion-module-canon-network-legacy-http&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Companion module for controlling &lt;strong>Canon cameras&lt;/strong> via the legacy HTTP network API. Allows driving compatible Canon cameras from a Stream Deck.&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Language: JavaScript · Protocol: HTTP&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2>companion-module-powersoft-amplifier&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="companion-module-powersoft-amplifier">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#companion-module-powersoft-amplifier" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Repository&lt;/strong> · &lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/companion-module-powersoft-amplifier" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/dewiweb/companion-module-powersoft-amplifier&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Companion module for controlling &lt;strong>Powersoft amplifiers&lt;/strong>. Monitor and control Powersoft amps (X series, Quattrocanali, etc.) from a Stream Deck.&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Language: TypeScript&lt;/li>
&lt;li>UNICA HTTP API, UDP feedback, WebSocket meters&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2>companion-module-oppo-bdp&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="companion-module-oppo-bdp">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#companion-module-oppo-bdp" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Repository&lt;/strong> · &lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/companion-module-oppo-bdp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/dewiweb/companion-module-oppo-bdp&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Companion module for &lt;strong>OPPO Blu-ray players&lt;/strong> (BDP-83/93/95/103/105) via the player&amp;rsquo;s TCP control protocol. Playback, navigation and settings from a Stream Deck.&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Language: JavaScript · Protocol: TCP&lt;/li>
&lt;li>License: MIT&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>holophonix_blender_addon</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/holophonix-blender-addon/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/holophonix-blender-addon/</guid><description>
