&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>StageNeth</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/stageneth/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/stageneth/</guid><description>
&lt;div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:1.2rem 0 1.8rem;">
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/stageneth" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dewiweb/stageneth?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;color=6366f1&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="GitHub stars" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/stageneth/commits" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/dewiweb/stageneth?style=flat-square&amp;color=10b981&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="Last commit" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/languages/top/dewiweb/stageneth?style=flat-square&amp;color=f59e0b&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Router OS designed for live performance environments&lt;/strong>, based on &lt;strong>OpenWrt&lt;/strong>. StageNeth separates audio/video/lighting (AV) streams from the management network and provides the services stage equipment relies on: DHCP, NTP, mDNS, SNMP and PTP.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Vue 3 web UI&lt;/strong> over HTTPS — simple mode (operator) and expert mode (tech)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Secured Go API&lt;/strong> (HttpOnly sessions, argon2id passwords, operator/tech roles)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Go network orchestrator&lt;/strong> — automatic generation of 802.1q VLANs, bridges, firewall, DHCP, QoS/NIC tuning and PTP&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Per-service configuration&lt;/strong> — each protocol (Dante, NDI, AES67/RAVENNA, ST 2110, Art-Net, sACN, PTP, AVB, NMOS, MA-Net…) gets its own VLAN, DSCP, priority and MTU&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Configurable AV trunk and dedicated ST 2110 interface with jumbo frames (MTU 9000)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>NTP server with DHCP option 42 per VLAN, mDNS reflector across AV VLANs&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Monitoring: CPU/memory/services, alerts, filterable logs, SNMP v2c/v3 agent, Prometheus metrics&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Status&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="status">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#status" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>🚧 &lt;strong>Active development&lt;/strong> (v0.2.0-beta) — validate on the bench before any production use.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Links&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="links">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/stageneth" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Languages: Go, Vue 3, OpenWrt&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>DewiCom</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/dewicom/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/dewicom/</guid><description>
&lt;div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:1.2rem 0 1.8rem;">
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/dewicom" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dewiweb/dewicom?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;color=6366f1&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="GitHub stars" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/dewicom/commits" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/dewiweb/dewicom?style=flat-square&amp;color=10b981&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="Last commit" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/languages/top/dewiweb/dewicom?style=flat-square&amp;color=f59e0b&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Local WiFi intercom for stage technicians&lt;/strong> — a multi-channel Push-To-Talk app: zero installation, zero cloud, zero subscription. All communications run over HTTPS/WSS (self-signed certificate generated at startup) to guarantee microphone access on every device.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Architecture — 3 deployment levels&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="architecture--3-deployment-levels">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#architecture--3-deployment-levels" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Standalone Node.js server&lt;/strong> (Docker / dedicated) — level 1&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Desktop app&lt;/strong> Electron (Linux AppImage / Windows EXE)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Android app&lt;/strong> (APK)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Automatic failover between levels&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Multi-channel PTT over LAN&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Web UI shared across server, desktop and mobile&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Monitoring panel&lt;/li>
&lt;li>No external dependency&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Links&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="links">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/dewicom" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>audio-accessibility-system</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/audio-accessibility-system/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/audio-accessibility-system/</guid><description>
&lt;div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:1.2rem 0 1.8rem;">
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/audio-accessibility-system" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dewiweb/audio-accessibility-system?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;color=6366f1&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="GitHub stars" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/audio-accessibility-system/commits" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/dewiweb/audio-accessibility-system?style=flat-square&amp;color=10b981&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="Last commit" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/languages/top/dewiweb/audio-accessibility-system?style=flat-square&amp;color=f59e0b&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>DIY multichannel audio distribution system&lt;/strong> for theatres, conference halls and cinemas (~450 seats), designed for &lt;strong>audio description&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>hearing assistance&lt;/strong> (hard-of-hearing audiences) and &lt;strong>multilingual simultaneous interpretation&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Audio is received via &lt;strong>AES67/RTP&lt;/strong> from the mixing console, encoded to &lt;strong>HLS&lt;/strong> by FFmpeg and served to audience smartphones through a &lt;strong>PWA&lt;/strong> — no app to install.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Node.js backend + HLS streaming (HTTPS/TLS)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>AES67/RTP multicast input (L24/48 kHz) from QSYS/Dante consoles&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Listener PWA + control-room admin UI&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Security (JWT, CSP, bcrypt), Docker/Portainer deployment&lt;/li>
&lt;li>CI/CD GitHub Actions → GHCR (amd64 + arm64)&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Status&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="status">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#status" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>✅ Operational — real-world testing (450 clients) in progress; WebRTC (&amp;lt; 200 ms) planned to reduce latency.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Links&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="links">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/audio-accessibility-system" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>nextevents</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/nextevents/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/nextevents/</guid><description>
&lt;div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:1.2rem 0 1.8rem;">
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
